	"templar-vows": {"category": CATEGORY_DETACHMENT, "name": "Templar Vows (Vow-sworn Crusaders)", "supported": true, "source_status": "wahapedia_e11_space_marines_page_v2_8_1_observed_2026_10_26_plus_local_export_20261021T130623Z", "validation_status": "implemented_local_checks_pending", "scope": "At the start of battle round 1, a Black Templars player using Vow-sworn Crusaders may choose one of all three Templar Vows. Abhor the Witch adds Precision and Lance to current-reference Adeptus Astartes melee attacks against PSYKER targets. Accept Any Challenge adds +1 to Wound rolls for current-reference Adeptus Astartes melee attacks when target Toughness exceeds weapon Strength. Uphold secures objectives controlled by current-reference Adeptus Astartes Infantry and permits those units to start otherwise eligible actions after Advancing. Requires current unit abilities and Black Templars Chapter context. Augury Servo-host, Consecrating Aura, Incendiary Animus and Zealous Vanguard are tracked as supported enhancements; Pious Enmity, For the Emperor's Honour!, Spoor of the Unholy, Dread Crusaders, Devout Push and Heresy Begets Retribution are supported stratagems. The 2 DP Force Disposition and full army legality remain unsupported or unenforced; focused checks, playtesting and network validation remain pending."},
